----------------------------------------------------------------------
OpenClaw - Tool patterns and inspiration
----------------------------------------------------------------------

Several Wings Of World tools were inspired by extensions from the OpenClaw
project:

    https://github.com/steipete/openclaw
    Copyright (c) 2025 Peter Steinberger
    Licensed under the MIT License

Specifically:

  - `server/features/web-fetch.ts`        <- inspired by `extensions/web-readability`
  - `server/features/document-extract.ts` <- inspired by `extensions/document-extract`
  - `server/features/tavily-search.ts`    <- inspired by `extensions/tavily`

The Wings Of World implementations are independent rewrites that drop the
OpenClaw plugin SDK in favour of direct dependencies on
`@mozilla/readability`, `linkedom`, `pdfjs-dist`, and the Tavily REST
API. We retain attribution here because the design and tool surface
are derivative.
